38.0s] step 3   calling hubspot__companies query='\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588'\r\n  [ 38.0s] step 3   calling hubspot__companies query='\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588'\r\n  [ 39.0s] step 3   got hubspot__companies (5 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 39.0s] step 3   got hubspot__companies (6 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 39.0s] step 4   deciding what to look at\r\n  [ 49.6s] step 4   got read hubspot.search in full (\u2588\u2588 rows) (6 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 49.6s] step 5   deciding what to look at\r\n  [ 58.9s] step 5   calling hubspot__activities\r\n  [ 58.9s] step 5   calling hubspot__companies query='\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588'\r\n  [ 62.2s] step 5   got hubspot__activities (7 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 62.2s] step 5   got hubspot__companies (8 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 62.2s] step 6   deciding what to look at\r\n  [ 85.9s]          drafting the report from 8 observation(s)\r\n  [102.8s]          checking every citation resolves\r\n  [102.8s]          re-reading each claim against its own evidence\r\n  sufficiency gate: skipped, this report asserts no cause\r\n  [110.9s]          writing the report\r\n\r\n==============================================================================\r\nQ: Which open deals have had no activity in the last 30 days, and what are they worth?\r\n==============================================================================\r\n\r\nConfidence: low\r\nTook 103s over 6 steps, 51,422 tokens, 8 observations gathered, 4 cited\r\n\r\nANSWER\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  No open deals meet the strict test of 'no HubSpot record modification in the last \u2588\u2588 days (since 2026-08-31)' \u2014 all \u2588\u2588 open deals, worth $\u2588,\u2588\u2588\u2588,\u2588\u2588\u2588 combined, show hs_lastmodifieddate within that window.  [hubspot.search 71274737, hubspot.search a8e547c6]\r\n  However, this field is only a proxy for genuine sales activity; a spot check on the \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 ac\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 found a real ~\u2588-month gap in emails despite the deal record showing recent modification, so the true \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 of stale deals may be under\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588d and would need per-deal engagement review to confirm.  [hubspot.pipeline 573ad384, hubspot.activities ac9716ff]\r\n\r\nFINDINGS\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  No open deals show a HubSpot record modification older than \u2588\u2588 days  (medium)\r\n    - A direct query for open deals last modified before 2026-08-31 returned \u2588 of \u2588\u2588 matching records, meaning every open deal's HubSpot record has been touched within the last \u2588\u2588 days by this field.  [hubspot.search 71274737, hubspot.search a8e547c6]\r\n    - The full open pipeline is \u2588\u2588 deals totaling $\u2588,\u2588\u2588\u2588,\u2588\u2588\u2588, all with hs_lastmodifieddate on or after 2026-08-31.  [hubspot.search a8e547c6]\r\n\r\nRISKS AND CAVEATS\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  - The only activity signal queried was hs_lastmodifieddate on the deal object itself, which can be updated by automated processes, not just human engagement (emails, calls, meetings). A true 'no activity in \u2588\u2588 days' answer would require checking engagement timelines (as done for one company) across all \u2588\u2588 open deals/companies, which was not exhaustively performed.\r\n  - Company-level engagement history was checked for only one ac\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 (\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588) as a spot check; it is not representative of all \u2588\u2588 open deals and cannot be generalized.\r\n  - \u2588 claim(s) were removed because an independent check found the cited evidence did not support them. Treat the remaining conclusions with corresponding caution.\r\n\r\nDATA QUALITY\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  - HubSpot deal search exposes hs_lastmodifieddate but not a dedicated 'last activity' field; engagement-level activity (emails, calls, meetings) must be pulled per-company/deal via a separate activities endpoint, which is not practical to run for all \u2588\u2588 open deals in this pass.\r\n  - The github commits sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The github deployments sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The github issues sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The github links sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The posthog annotations sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The posthog events sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n\r\nSOURCES\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  ac9716ff  hubspot.activities  hubspot://crm/v3/objects/companies/\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588/engagements\r\n  573ad384  hubspot.pipeline  hubspot://crm/v3/objects/deals/search?open=true\r\n  71274737  hubspot.search  hubspot://crm/v3/objects/deals/search?hs_is_closed=false&hs_lastmodifieddate[LT]=2026-08-31\r\n  a8e547c6  hubspot.search  hubspot://crm/v3/objects/deals/search?hs_is_closed=false&hs_lastmodifieddate[GTE]=2026-08-31\r\r\n\r\nphase breakdown (111s wall, 109s measured)\r\n  phase        calls  seconds  share    mean  tokens\r\n  survey           1     12.1   11%    12.1  no model call\r\n  recall           1    0.020    0%   0.020  no model call\r\n  loop_model       6     66.0   60%    11.0  in 12 out 5,564 cached 113,616\r\n  loop_tools       5      7.7    7%     1.5  no model call\r\n  draft            1     16.9   15%    16.9  in 44,280 out 1,566\r\n  gate             1    0.034    0%   0.034  no model call\r\n  verify           1      6.0    5%     6.0  in 21,373 out 749\r\n  sufficiency      1   <0.001    0%  <0.001  no model call\r\n  unmeasured              2.1    2%\r\n  cache hit rate: 63%\r\n"]
